<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38979" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβρομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roar upon</i> or <i>over</i>, of the sea, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπιλάδεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1371
				</span></i>
			; of sea-birds, <i>scream over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελάγεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.240
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c. acc.
			cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρύχημα</span>, of lions, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτύπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					6.115
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφρ᾽. . ἐπιβρομέωνται ἀκουαί</span>
			<i>may be filled with the sound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.908
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
